            ("In clubs and societies, the equivalent of owners' capital is referred to as the:", ["Accumulated Fund", "Retained Dividends", "Share Capital", "Working Reserve"], 0, "Accumulated Fund represents total assets minus total liabilities accumulated from past surpluses.", "Non-Profit Accounts"),
            ("Subscriptions in arrears at the end of a club's financial year are classified on its balance sheet as:", ["A current asset (receivable owed by members)", "A current liability", "An accumulated fund surplus", "A deferred dividend"], 0, "Unpaid member subscriptions are legal receivables due to the organization.", "Club Accounts"),
